            "text": "Any passenger",
            "rationale": "Wrong: any passenger is not enough; the supervisor must be licensed."
          },
          {
            "key": "C",
            "text": "A sibling with a permit",
            "rationale": "Wrong: a permit holder cannot supervise another permit holder."
          },
          {
            "key": "D",
            "text": "Nobody",
            "rationale": "Wrong: permit driving is never unsupervised."
